<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Adsteam half yr net loss A$1.35 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Adsteam half yr net loss A$1.35 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>		  (A$ million unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		     profit 1.77 vs loss 23.53</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 1.35 vs profit 85.16</p>
<p>    Sales				   89.07 vs 559.56</p>
<p>    Other income			  90.18 vs  52.69</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 0.29 vs loss 9.72</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items		   nil vs profit 101.67</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     loss 0.6  vs loss 7.1</p>
<p>    Tax					1.30 vs  0.74</p>
<p>    Interest				20.89 vs  58.33</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   1.59 vs 10.19</p>
<p>    Minorities		     debit 1.52 vs credit 17.48</p>
<p>NOTE: The Adelaide Steamship Co Ltd is an investment group. The results are reported on a consolidated economic entity basis.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
